  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: EscapeFire.Runtime::EscapeFire.Lesson.LessonStation
  title: "4. B\xE1o ch\xE1y v\xE0 g\u1ECDi 114"
  explanation: "Ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n ch\xE1y: h\xF4 to \"Ch\xE1y! Ch\xE1y!\", \u1EA5n
    n\xFAt b\xE1o ch\xE1y, g\u1ECDi 114. Khi g\u1ECDi n\xF3i r\xF5: \u0111\u1ECBa
