    k\u1EB9t kh\xF4ng."
  ruleId: R01_ALARM_EARLY
  question: "Khi g\u1ECDi 114 c\u1EA7n n\xF3i nh\u1EEFng g\xEC?"
  options:
  - "Ch\u1EC9 n\xF3i \"c\xF3 ch\xE1y\""
  - "\u0110\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9, t\u1EA7ng, \u0111ang ch\xE1y g\xEC, c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
    k\u1EB9t kh\xF4ng"
  - "T\xEAn v\xE0 s\u1ED1 \u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i"
  correctOption: 1
  whyCorrect: "L\u1EF1c l\u01B0\u1EE3ng ch\u1EEFa ch\xE1y c\u1EA7n bi\u1EBFt n\u01A1i
    n\xE0o, ch\xE1y g\xEC, c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EAFc k\u1EB9t kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EC3
    xu\u1EA5t ph\xE1t \u0111\xFAng."
